# 8. What Is Included and Excluded

This section defines the general boundaries of Klaud’s professional services. Specific inclusions and exclusions may vary depending on the selected pricing model, service bundle, customer environment, and agreed statement of work.

The purpose of this section is to provide partners with a clear understanding of what Klaud typically delivers, what must be provided by the partner or customer, and which items require separate scope, pricing, or commercial approval.

Final scope is always subject to technical validation before project commitment.

---

## 8.1 Generally Included Services

Unless otherwise stated in the agreed scope, Klaud’s services may include the following activities.

### Technical Discovery and Assessment

Klaud may support discovery and assessment activities required to understand the customer environment, technical requirements, risks, and project readiness.

This may include:

* Technical discovery sessions
* Current-state review
* Environment assessment
* Infrastructure readiness review
* Workload domain planning
* Version and compatibility review
* Risk identification
* Prerequisite validation
* High-level recommendations
* Delivery approach definition

### Architecture and Design

Klaud may provide architecture and design services for VMware Cloud Foundation, private cloud, hybrid cloud, and related infrastructure technologies.

This may include:

* Target-state architecture
* High-level design
* Low-level design
* Workload domain architecture
* vSphere design
* vSAN design
* NSX design
* VCF Operations design
* VCF Automation design
* VKS enablement design
* Disaster recovery design
* Security and segmentation design
* Migration strategy
* Lifecycle management planning

### Implementation and Configuration

Klaud may perform or support implementation activities within the agreed technical scope.

This may include:

* VMware Cloud Foundation deployment
* Workload domain deployment
* vSphere configuration
* vSAN configuration
* NSX configuration
* VCF Operations integration
* VCF Automation foundation setup
* VKS enablement
* VMware Live Recovery / SRM implementation
* HCX enablement
* NSX ALB / AVI deployment
* vDefend Firewall starter implementation
* Lifecycle management configuration
* Validation of deployed components

### Upgrade, Migration, and Stabilization Support

Klaud may support upgrade, migration, and stabilization activities where included in the selected bundle or statement of work.

This may include:

* Upgrade readiness review
* Upgrade planning
* Migration planning
* Change window planning
* Rollback planning
* Execution support
* Issue investigation
* Remediation recommendations
* Stabilization support
* Post-upgrade or post-migration validation

### Documentation and Knowledge Transfer

Klaud may provide documentation and knowledge transfer related to the services delivered.

This may include:

* Technical findings report
* Readiness checklist
* Risk register
* High-level design document
* Low-level design document
* Implementation runbook
* Validation checklist
* As-built documentation
* Operational recommendations
* Knowledge transfer session
* Handover session

### Project Coordination Related to Technical Delivery

Klaud may participate in project coordination activities directly related to the technical services being delivered.

This may include:

* Technical planning meetings
* Delivery status updates
* Change window coordination
* Risk and issue discussions
* Partner technical alignment
* Customer technical alignment, when agreed
* Delivery milestone review

Klaud’s role is technical and advisory. Overall project management, customer account management, contract management, and commercial governance remain the responsibility of the partner unless otherwise agreed.

